ng her via a ship  a hurricane hit the boat and evelyn  freaked out which caused her to create  this black substance known as the mold  when enough mold comes together they  can create the molded enemies we see  throughout the game eventually the ship  was torn apart and mia evelyn and the  ship were washed ashore near the baker  estate the bakers being the loving and  healthy family that they are  not only cared for mia but also evelyn  but they didn't understand what evelyn  was  they just assumed she was a little girl  evelyn sees the opportunity to infect  the entire family  starting with marguerite then to jack  lucas and zoe are also infected but they  aren't as far gone as their parents they  both have regenerative abilities which  is a side effect of the mold but both  parents are under the mind control of  evelyn whereas zoe and lucas aren't the  connections eventually discovered  evelyn's new location so they set up a  base near assault mine not too far from  the house they also hired lucas as a  researcher so they could monitor evelyn  from afar leading up to evelyn's arrival  from 2014 to 2017 lucas would work with  the connections and inevitably kill all  the researchers to harness the mold for  himself and the bakers would end up  kidnapping people under evelyn's control  so she can have a much bigger family one  of these people she attempted to kidnap  was ethan as evelyn compelled mia into  sending the original message to him so  as ethan and we must find mia and escape  things definitely don't go that simple  as we have boss fights with both jack  and marguerite we end up getting trapped  in lucas's mini-games all while fighting  the molded that was created since  evelyn's arrival we also find out that  neither zone or mia can leave the house  without the serum to cure them we only  have enough for one as we ended up using  the other to kill jack  we save mia as that's the canon ending  and as we approach the wreckage evelyn  flips our raft evelyn c