died and miro  got the short end of the cadao stick  since he is clearly the most mutated out  of the four  and has the ability to transform into a  giant fish which he cannot control  this lack of power caused him to feel  hated by the others so he shut himself  away heisenberg is the unique one of the  group as he is arguably the smartest and  strongest of the four  he owns the nearby factory and  underneath has created an entire robot  army the purpose for this is because he  wants revenge for what miranda did to  him  he seems to be the only one of the four  who holds a grudge against her so he's  been secretly plotting a rebellion  against miranda so that she can pay for  cursing him with his power  that power being the ability to  manipulate magnetic fields and control  electricity after defeating heisenberg  we meet with mother miranda and she rips  ethan's heart out  as we're left stunned by what just  happened we hear chris give us a quick  recap about our time  in the village he explains that mother  miranda was mia and that even though she  looked dead she was only faking it she  was also the cause of the crash at the  beginning of the game  chris after ethan's fight with  heisenberg went to find him but he was  already dead  we now get to play as chris and take her  down after going through the large info  dump laboratory we find mia  actually mia this time not mother  miranda like we stated  chris gives her the news that ethan is  dead but she explains that that's  impossible and that he needs to find him  because he's very special  ethan out of nowhere wakes up and we  hear a familiar voice  evelyn has returned somehow even though  we killed her back at the baker house  evelyn and ethan talk with each other  and we uncover probably the biggest  twist in the whole game  evelyn explains that when we got knocked  out by jack back in re7  he actually killed us we didn't wake up  and survive and eat at the dinner table  we died there this explains how ethan is  able to literally attach his arm back  into place like it's nothing it's not  just the first aid meds that are helping  it's the mold in his body this isn't one  of those weird situations where he's  slightly infected and has those regen  abilities like the others do his entire  body is  literal mold as we can see now when even  later in the game  we see that his hand is becoming  calcified as ethan collapses the duke  picks us up and drops us off near mother  miranda so that we can kill her we do  get a bit of slight help from chris but  it's mostly just 1v1 against her in  typical resident evil fashion once again  she does  transform into some hideous creature as  ethan kills mother miranda chris grabs  both him and rows and escorts them to  safety chris has a plan to blow the  whole mega my seat up along with the  whole village  ethan already knowing he's close to  death though gives chris rose in his  jacket  takes the detonator and finishes the job  himself what a  crazy ending that was now that the  ending is over though what exactly is  next for the resident evil story  well we're most likely going to be  getting dlc in an eventual ninth main  title in the series so there's tons more  for us to explore in the world  but what are we doing and where are we  going well back at the helicopter a  member of chris's squad shows us one of  the bsaa members we spotted during the  intro to chris's sequence they seem to  be infected with something as they  aren't human  chris tells the pilot to head for the  bsa hq in europe as someone has some  explaining to do in the concept art for  the bsaa members we read the description  that says the bsaa are now a raw and  ruin organization who are using soldiers  created with new technology so it seems  like the bsa  are going to be put in some hot water in  the next part of the story whether  that's dlc  or a full new game my guess is we'll  probably go back to chris for some time  or we might see another protagonist  that new one could end up being rose as  an end credit scene does show us  a grown-up rose probably around 20 30  visiting ethan's grave we can see that  the bsa are keeping a close eye on her  since as we discover thanks to the  infected mold from both ethan and mia  she now has power similar to  if not better than evelyn this is a plot  device i cannot  wait to see unfold with that however we  do come to the end of the video  and the end of resident evil village for  now at least  let me know in the comments below how  you enjoyed the video as well as the  game itself as someone who's recently  gotten to resident evil a lot more with  the release of re7 it sucks to see ethan  go like this but i have no issue playing  as chris again he's a staple of the  franchise and for good reason  he's an excellent protagonist with that  however though like the video if you do  enjoy subscribe if you're new and  take care everybody goodbye  [Music]  you
 

